  "description": "We challenged the engineering and design team here at Rambo to develop a folding bike that was Rambo tough. The result is the Rambo Ranger Folding E-Bike. Lightweight and compact, yet able to hit the woods and backcountry trails. The Ranger is as versatile as they come with hassle-free storage in small spaces. Grab groceries, cruise the city, or push the limits. The Rambo Ranger is a great choice if you are looking for a robust built yet economical bike that won’t leave you stranded. The bike was designed with total weight and mobility in mind yet keeping it Rambo tough. The Step-thru frame design allows for an easy on-and-off ride. The result is a solid, portable, durable, and reliable option.",
